source: crates/forgejo-core/src/error/render.rs
expression: "snap(ErrorKind::RepoNotFound\n{\n    slug: \"perf3ct/fcli\".into(), host: \"git.example.org\".into(), login:\n    Some(\"perf3ct\".into()), probed: false, server_message:\n    Some(\"could not find 'no-such-branch' to be a commit, branch or tag\".into(),),\n}, c)"
---
error: repository or resource not found under perf3ct/fcli on git.example.org (HTTP 404)

  request:      POST /api/v1/repos/perf3ct/fcli/pulls
  repository:   perf3ct/fcli  (not checked)
  host:         git.example.org
  logged in as: perf3ct
  server says:  could not find 'no-such-branch' to be a commit, branch or tag
  token from:   the OS keyring, entry fcli:git.example.org

what to do:
  the repository check was disabled or failed. The repository or a referenced
  resource may be missing.
  1. fcli api repos/perf3ct/fcli  (check repository access)
  2. another 404 may mean the repository is missing, private with a token
     that lacks read:repository, or on another server. Check: fcli auth status
  3. if it succeeds, check the resources referenced by the request:
     branch, tag, or user names
